    <h1 class="msv-hero__title">How to Renew Your Student Visa in Spain: Complete 2026 Guide</h1>
    <p class="msv-hero__intro">Student visas in Spain are typically issued for the duration of the academic year or course. If your studies continue beyond your initial visa period, you'll need to renew. Here's exactly how the student visa renewal process works in 2026.</p>
  </div>
